## Key Technical Facts to Remember

### Approval flow (2-step)
1. User clicks Approve → status: `pending` → `executed`
2. Scheduler `execute_approved_posts` runs every 15 min → posts at `scheduled_post_time`
**Never call executor at approval time.**

### Datetime convention
- `created_at` → `datetime.utcnow()` (naive, legacy)
- `scheduled_post_time` → `datetime.now(timezone.utc)` (aware)
- Never mix them in comparisons

### Kickoff day
Stored in `biz.briefing_time` as day name ("Sunday", "Monday" etc.)
`get_posting_schedule(biz)` reads `biz.posting_schedule` array, falls back to defaults

### strategy_summary
Always use `strategy.get("key_message", ...)` — never full strategy dict

### DB session in background tasks
Always create new session: `async with AsyncSessionLocal() as db:`
Never pass request's db session into `asyncio.create_task()`

### Debug reset command
```powershell
Invoke-WebRequest -Method DELETE "https://api.marlo021.ai/debug/reset/3512ed4f-9dae-499e-9f5d-fdb0d85269ef"
```

